{%- comment -%}
  Fallback card matching New Arrivals Redesign specification with QuickView support
  Parameters:
    - index: Loop index for staggered animation delay
    - show_category: Boolean
    - cat_id: String ('all', 'clothing', 'tech', 'organic', 'global', 'essentials', 'jewellery', 'cookware', 'hampers', 'bags', 'accessories')
    - item_index: Number (0..5)
{%- endcomment -%}

